  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rising Nations Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To advance efforts towards protecting the statehood of Pacific Atoll countries, preserving their sovereignty and safeguarding the rights and heritage of affected populations. The Heritage project will capture the narrative of Tuvalu, Kiribati, and Marshall Islands, its peoples, culture and heritage and establish a solid base of visual, multimedia, and audio records and knowledge building a permanent repository of visuals, assisting these countries with safeguarding and communicating its national narrative regionally and globally.</narrative>
  </description>
